Now, you might recognize him because he played Bruce Wayne on the television show Gotham.

128
00:05:25.480 --> 00:05:26.960
Oh, my God.

129
00:05:27.100 --> 00:05:27.700
Yes.

130
00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:28.940
Oh, my God.

131
00:05:28.980 --> 00:05:29.580
Yeah.

132
00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:31.940
No way.

